/-!
# The low-resolution layout and Kronecker images of the `μ > 0` passing guiding-centre torus family
certificate

Layout `N = 16`, `M = 12`, Chebyshev degree `D = 5`, scale `2^{−60}`; for every variable: the
stored coefficients `famLM i` (with symbol `c0LM i` and parity `oddLM i`), the weight `WtLM i`, the
degree box `BxLM i`, the static `ℓ¹` bound `LLM i`, the minimal widths `bMinLM i`, `wMinLM i` of
the fast images, and the Kronecker image `KvLM b W R i` (fast: `famTB − famO`; generic: `famPack`).
Variables `0, 1, 2, 3` are `t`, `V`, `cos 2φ`, `sin 2φ`; variable `114` is the parameter
`r = 64 + cos ϑ = 51 + 64λ`; the special variables are 0, 1, 2, 3, 77, 78, 79, 101, 102, 103, 104,
105, 106, 107, 109, 111, 112, 113, 114. Light module (kernel checks only).

Pitch cell `λ ∈ [3/16, 7/32]`: modules `RationalStellaratorGCMu4*`,
namespace `PlasmaLean.Design.RationalStellaratorGC.Mu4`; generated by
`scripts/gc_kam/lamcell` from the pipeline of the cell `[0, 1/16]`.
-/

